● Oversee level design and feature planning for the Talking Tom series products, manage product lifecycle effectively, and deliver in-depth analysis reports on version update performance. 
● Organize and sort out product requirements, complete PRD and related system documentation, and collaborate with art, R&D and QA teams to support product launches and update iterations. 
● Take charge of game economy system and numerical tuning, balance IAP purchase and ad monetization logic, and drive the improvement of product LTV and commercial KPIs. 
● Follow up on ad-related product requirements, including in-game product pricing calibration, product issue tracking and rectification implementation.
 ● Cooperate with growth and operation teams, combine UA channel data and operational insights to continuously optimize core product metrics and improve user acquisition efficiency.
 ● Optimize product experience based on user behavior data analysis, and improve core metrics such as user retention and daily usage duration through scientific product iteration methods. 
● Track market trends and competitor dynamics, collect industry data and insights efficiently, and support continuous product optimization and iteration.

● 统筹汤姆猫系列产品的关卡与功能规划,对产品生命周期进行有效管理,针对版本效果输出深度分析报告;
 ● 负责产品需求梳理与PRD、系统文档输出,联动美术、研发、测试团队,推动产品上线与版本迭代落地;
 ● 负责游戏经济系统与数值调优,平衡内购付费与广告变现逻辑,驱动产品LTV及各项商业化指标提升; 
● 跟进广告相关产品需求,包括产品价格标定、产品问题跟进与整改落地等相关工作;
 ● 与增长、运营团队紧密协作,结合买量渠道数据与运营洞察,持续优化产品核心指标,赋能用户获取效率提升;
 ● 基于用户行为数据分析开展产品体验优化,运用科学的产品迭代方法,提升用户留存、使用时长等核心指标;
 ● 跟踪市场风向与竞品动态,高效收集行业数据与洞察,支撑产品持续优化与迭代。

● Bachelor’s degree or above
● Strong sense of responsibility and pursuit of excellence, result-oriented, with the ability to coordinate cross-team resources to solve problems. 
● Excellent analytical judgment, logical thinking and data analysis capabilities, with sharp insight into user psychology and demands. 
● Proficient in office software, with solid document output and data processing skills. 
● Practical English for daily written business communication.
 ● Passion for the gaming industry, with a deep understanding of mobile game product operation and monetization logic.

● 本科及以上学历
● 具备高度责任心与极致追求精神,结果导向,善于协调跨团队资源解决问题;
 ● 具备优秀的分析判断、逻辑思维与数据分析能力,能够敏锐洞察用户心理与需求;
 ● 熟练使用相关办公软件,具备扎实的文档输出与数据处理能力; 
● 具备良好的英语能力,可完成日常书面商务沟通;
● 热爱游戏行业,对移动游戏产品运营与商业化逻辑有深度理解。

● 3+ years of hands-on experience in game product operations, with proven track record in product iteration or monetization optimization is highly preferred. 
● Experience in casual games, virtual pet games or Talking Tom series products is a strong plus. 
● Experience in game economy balancing, numerical tuning or UA data collaboration is preferred.

● 拥有3年以上游戏产品运营实操经验,有产品迭代或商业化优化成功案例者优先;
 ● 有休闲游戏、养成类游戏或汤姆猫系列产品相关经验者优先;
 ● 有游戏经济平衡、数值调优或买量数据联动经验者优先。
